    "rich_text_hxAiDD": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_FCGn66": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Work with People Who Love What They Do",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_QMfKWq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At PSC, we've been designing and building steering systems for decades. From CNC machining and manufacturing to assembly and shipping, every person on the team plays a role in getting quality products out the door.<br/><br/>If you enjoy solving problems, working with your hands, and being part of a team that values doing things right, you'll feel right at home here.</p><h2>What We Do</h2><p>We design and build steering components for trucks, Jeeps, UTVs, race vehicles, and off-road builds. Every day, our team machines parts, assembles products, ships orders, and supports customers across the country.</p><h2>Why Work Here</h2><ul><li><strong>Steady Work, Solid Team</strong><br/>We're not a giant corporation. You'll work alongside people who know your name and appreciate the work you do.</li><li><strong>Hands-On Every Day</strong><br/>Whether you're machining parts, building products, or helping ship orders, you'll stay busy and see the results of your work.</li><li><strong>Build Something Real</strong><br/>The products leaving our facility are trusted by builders, racers, and off-road enthusiasts across the country. You'll be part of the team that makes it happen.</li></ul><h2>Who We’re Looking For</h2><p>People who:</p><ul><li>Show up on time and do what they say they'll do.</li><li>Pay attention to the details.</li><li>Enjoy learning new skills and solving problems.</li><li>Work well with others and aren't afraid to jump in where needed.</li></ul><p>Experience with steering systems or hydraulics is a plus, but mechanical aptitude, a strong work ethic, and a willingness to learn go a long way. We'll help you learn the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
